nce understanding?\n5. **Broader impact and significance**: Who benefits from these findings? How broadly applicable are the results?\n6. **Writing quality**: Is the paper well-written? Are the arguments logically structured?\n7. **Venue fit**: Does this paper fit a top ML venue, or would it be better suited elsewhere (e.g., SE venue)?\n\n## Output Format\n\n### R2 Review: Novelty and Related Work\n\n**Summary** (2-3 sentences)\n\n**Strengths** (numbered list)\n\n**Weaknesses** (numbered list — be specific)\n\n**Questions for Authors** (numbered list)\n\n**Missing References** (if any)\n\n**Minor Issues** (if any)\n\n**Preliminary Score**: X/6\n**Confidence**: X/5\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Evaluate whether the novelty meets the bar for a top ML venue with ~25% acceptance rate."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JdhxtM16ANYriULMCAxyE3","session_id":"801e815f-639b-4202-aae5-0f4f3a5c9365","uuid":"74a6ba03-7725-454c-8899-5ee8f8bfaab8","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:54:00.518Z"}
